}

### POST new patient (Test Case 2)
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "Kwame",
  "lastName": "Nkrumah",
  "email": "kwame.nkrumah@clinic.org",
  "phoneNumber": "312-555-6789",
  "insurance": {
    "id": "{{insuranceId}}"
  }
}

